{"Returning null from getSubGroupsCount() violates the GroupModel interface contract, which specifies @return Never returns null. This shifts the NPE to callers (e.g., GroupUtils.populateSubGroupCount \u2192 auto-unbox) rather than fixing it. Follow the pattern used by getDelegateForUpdate() and throw IllegalStateException, or return 0L if the intent is to gracefully handle a concurrently-deleted group.": 0.9604395627975464, "The reader thread is never joined before the assertion. After deletedAll.set(true), the main thread immediately asserts on caughtExceptions, but the reader thread may still be mid-iteration \u2014 an exception caught during its final loop could be added to caughtExceptions after the assertion passes, making this test flaky. Save the Thread reference and call join() before asserting.": 0.9602782726287842}